          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "TL 0714           FLAMSTEAD             HIGH STREET                                         (South side) 9/31                                    No. 12                                         (The Little House) GV                                      II House. Early C19. Red brick with slate roof. Rear has many blue bricks in walling. W flank wall has timber studs exposed on upper floor to rear. Infill house with very narrow frontage and double-pile deep plan. N front has plank door up 2 steps, a tall flush sash window to LH with 6/6 panes and segmental arch. Similar window central to 1st floor with 8/8  panes.  Central  chimney.  Projects  to  rear with  small  2-lights casement windows. Included for group value. Listing NGR: TL0788414598"
    }
